                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Currently, `mini.indentscope` only show indent line for cursor line/block. What I want is: show indent line for every block even my cursor not in it. Here is a screenshot, how to show indent line for the red area?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"354\" alt=\"x\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/345274/159111524-bb46421b-c031-495f-834f-dbb6cb5f53bf.png\">\r\n\r\nBy default, [lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim](https://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim) will show indent line for this.\r\n\r\n",
